        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo HR-120, 4-1/2 Inch Hinge Mounting Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMounting plate for 4-1/2\" high hinge. For use with steel doors or steel door frame. Standard 4-1/2 inch hinge template screw pattern. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-inch-hinge-reinforcement-plate-don-jo-hr-110\"><b>4 Inch Hinge Mounting Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-HR-120_size.gif?v=1704354579\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo HR-120 4.5 Inch Hinge plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse when existing mounting is missing, damaged or new 4-1/2\" hinge installation. Plate can be attached with screws, welding, or rivets to the inside of steel door or frame. Hinge mounting holes are tapped for <a href=\"/products/machine-screw-12-x-1-2-scms1205\">#12-24 hinge screws</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the HR-120 4-1/2\" Hinge Mounting Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Offset: 3/32\" (for standard weight .134\" thick hinge)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 7 Gauge (.179\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HR-120.pdf?v=1704262280\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo HR-120 Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
